 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_QU_ATTACKED_1','We shall record the form you chose and the form that succeeds it.'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_QU_DEFEAT_1','Seal the vaults. Leave a record of our first design.'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_QU_PEACE_1','We will put away the instruments of conquest. The terms will stand.'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_QU_FALLBACK_1','I have considered the terms. Let us speak plainly about what they require.'),
